 "about_this_app": {
  "snippet": "Fuel up. You’ve got things to chase.Whether it’s biryani that fires you up, or a much-needed dosa break, or a pizza after a long day — Zomato delivers what keeps you moving. With 1.5 million+ restaurants, we’re here to power your hustle, one meal at a time. Since 2008, we’ve kept India’s hungriest (and busiest) fed. Here’s what you get with the Zomato app: 1) Order food that keeps up with you:🍴Food. Fast. Anywhere. 1000+ cities. Day or night. From local legends to global chains — we deliver what drives you.📍Real-time tracking. Round-the-clock support. Watch every move your food makes. Got an issue? Chat with us, anytime.💳Smart payments. Bigger discounts.Pay safely & securely with UPI, cash on delivery or cards/wallets/netbanking/buy now pay later/Pluxee/Simpl. Plus, score up to 60% OFF or a free dish.💪Big day? No time? We got you. Missed lunch? Surprise guests? Office party? Too drained to cook? Open Zomato — we move fast so you don’t have to.👀Search like a pro. Eat like a boss. Dosas to dimsum, biryani to burgers — filter by cravings, mood, budget, or speed.🌿Veg? Healthy? No compromise. Choose veg-only joints or dive into nutritionist-approved meals. Balance, your way.2) Dine out like a regular:✅Find your next go-to spot Look up restaurant menus, ratings, reviews, photos, contact details, map directions. Use search filters to find restaurants that fit your budget or are close by, or just refer to our curated lists called ‘Collections’ — all in one scroll.👫Book tables, skip the line Hustlers don’t wait. Reserve ahead and walk right in.💰Pay smart. Earn while you eat. Pay your bill on Zomato to get the biggest discounts & up to 100% cashback.👌Rate, review, rep your favourites Share the love. Drop honest reviews and help fellow foodies make the right call.Zomato runs across India & UAE. Some features are city-specific. #1 food delivery app in India, according to Play Store ratings & SimilarWeb.",
